<title>USA: Missouri direct hogs up $1.00-1.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Missouri direct hogs up $1.00-1.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>JEFFERSON CITY 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said barrows and gilts were $1.00 to $1.50 higher than Monday's close. Top $55.00 per cwt.</p>
<p>    US 1-3  230-260 lbs    54.00-55.00</p>
<p>    US 2-3  260-270 lbs    53.00-54.00</p>
<p>		270-280 lbs    52.00-53.00</p>
<p>     Sows - up $1.00-2.00. Top $56.00.</p>
<p>    US 1-3    300-500 lbs    41.00-44.00</p>
<p>		  over 500 lbs    52.00-56.00</p>
</text>
